From 2f20178b01b4a5f4fde191fef08cd6e4f3987e78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bluevisor <bluevisor@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:45:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Debugger: arm64 architecture

- ArchitectureArm64/CpuStateArm64: x0-x30, sp, pc, cpsr, fpsr, fpcr,
  v0-v31; DWARF register map; frame record (x29/x30) unwinding with the
  link register for leaf and not yet set up frames; PLT stub resolution.
- Disassembly with Capstone (static, HAIKU_CAPSTONE_DIR); calls and
  jumps are classified by hand for stepping.
- DWARF CFI: on CPUs with a link register the caller's pc is the unwound
  REGISTER_TYPE_RETURN_ADDRESS register.
- Debugger: link a static libedit (HAIKU_LIBEDIT_DIR) when there is no
  libedit package, and ship the Debugger without that condition.
